<div class="page-heading"><span class="section-kicker">Antrean layanan</span><h1>Pengajuan surat</h1><p>Data identitas hanya ditampilkan kepada petugas sesuai izin.</p></div><section class="data-panel"><form class="row g-2 mb-3" method="get" action="/admin/pengajuan"><div class="col-md-5"><input class="form-control" name="q" value="<?= e($queryText) ?>" placeholder="Cari nama atau jenis surat" aria-label="Cari nama atau jenis surat"></div><div class="col-md-4"><select class="form-select" name="status"><option value="">Semua status</option><?php foreach ($statuses as $key => $label): ?><option value="<?= e($key) ?>" <?= $selectedStatus === $key ? 'selected' : '' ?>><?= e($label) ?></option><?php endforeach; ?></select></div><div class="col-md-3"><button class="btn btn-outline-success w-100" type="submit">Terapkan filter</button></div></form><input class="form-control form-control-sm mb-3" data-table-search="#applications-table" placeholder="Saring hasil yang tampil" aria-label="Saring hasil yang tampil"><div class="table-responsive"><table class="table align-middle" id="applications-table"><thead><tr><th>Warga</th><th>Jenis surat</th><th>Status</th><th>Masuk</th><th></th></tr></thead><tbody><?php foreach ($applications as $item): ?><tr><td><?= e($item['full_name']) ?></td><td><?= e($item['type_name']) ?></td><td><?= e(status_label($item['status'])) ?></td><td><?= e(date('d/m/Y H:i', strtotime($item['created_at']))) ?></td><td><a href="/admin/pengajuan/<?= (int) $item['id'] ?>">Tinjau</a></td></tr><?php endforeach; ?><?php if (!$applications): ?><tr><td colspan="5" class="text-center text-secondary py-4">Tidak ada pengajuan yang cocok.</td></tr><?php endif; ?></tbody></table></div><p class="small text-secondary mb-0">Menampilkan maksimal 100 pengajuan terbaru.</p></section>